PawanSetu — "Shop Local, Online" (customer explainer, 46 s, 1080×1920, 24 fps)
Picture, score and sound made entirely in code. The PawanSetu logo (indigo tile with a white "P", from pawansetu.in, used by the owner) is redrawn in the film's style; the app screens and the presenter are stand-ins drawn in code.
Claims used: customers can shop their local stores online, in minutes (confirmed by the owner); closing line from pawansetu.in: "Order from your local Agra shops, delivered by the shop." Shop and item names are fictional.

Third-party assets
- Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, fonts/OFL-*.txt, github.com/google/fonts): Alfa Slab One (JM Solé), Oleo Script (soytutype), Jost (Owen Earl / indestructible type*).
- Voice: Microsoft Edge neural text-to-speech, en-IN-NeerjaNeural, via edge-tts (github.com/rany2/edge-tts, LGPL-3.0). Online service: check Microsoft's terms before commercial use.
- Drawing engine: engine/toon.js, chars.js, icons.js adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT; the presenter restyled (kurta, braid).
- Instruments: pizzicato bass and music box are physically modelled (Lemo-Opuscar core/audio/pluck.py, MIT); vibraphone, flute, brushes, snaps, foley and room tone are synthesised here. No samples.
- Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT), Whisper small.en (MIT).
